l over there is John Doe.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Is that a serious question? Of course I know John Doe! He's John Doe. That guy's John Doe. Even the dude leaning against the wall over there is John Doe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40451","byteOffset":29631224,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_CEDC6203","articyId":"72057697117166632","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Time travel? Like go to sleep tonight wake up a hundred years ago? Nothing from CorpSec that I know of. There was a startup that tried something a few years ago.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Time travel? Like go to sleep tonight wake up a hundred years ago? Nothing from CorpSec that I know of. There was a startup that tried something a few years ago.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3975.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27999","byteOffset":18473344,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_287362FA","articyId":"72057697117166667","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Ha! Like you have a shot. Keep it moving.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha! Like you have a shot. Keep it moving.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":-150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28449","byteOffset":18644768,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_0EC2A1AC","articyId":"72057697117166676","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"That I do. Now what else do you want to know about?","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That I do. Now what else do you want to know about?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33257","byteOffset":20466168,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_A619C4A3","articyId":"72057697117166692","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Seems like a YOU problem.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Seems like a YOU problem.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52511","byteOffset":34278792,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_283DA808","articyId":"72057697117166700","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Ah, shit, I don't remember. They had some theory about speed and time ratios or something. They ended up hacking a tram to turn off the speed governor, boosted the electrical input while connecting two modified steam converters, and ZOOM off into the sunset.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, shit, I don't remember. They had some theory about speed and time ratios or something. They ended up hacking a tram to turn off the speed governor, boosted the electrical input while connecting two modified steam converters, and ZOOM off into the sunset.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4575.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20373","byteOffset":15591000,"byteLength":640}},{"id":"DFr_F5116926","articyId":"72057697117166722","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Haha, get this: they called themselves the Happy Hour Friends.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha, get this: they called themselves the Happy Hour Friends.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":5175.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40034","byteOffset":29475080,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_02CCAF89","articyId":"72057697117166737","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"I didn't say they were smart.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I didn't say they were smart.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":5775.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48489","byteOffset":32679512,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_C7E108A8","articyId":"72057697117166761","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Oh that train didn't actually go anywhere other than through a wall, off the track, and down to the bottom of the sea.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh that train didn't actually go anywhere other than through a wall, off the track, and down to the bottom of the sea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":6375.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44988","byteOffset":31354048,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_09B6EC5C","articyId":"72057697117166776","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Neon Gods with your questions. You are genuinely annoying, you know that?","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Neon Gods with your questions. You are genuinely annoying, you know that?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":6975.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44121","byteOffset":31026352,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_DF0E5396","articyId":"72057697117166798","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"About as much as I love CorpSec. You're both a strain on the limited amount of brain cells I have left.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"About as much as I love CorpSec. You're both a strain on the limited amount of brain cells I have left.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":7575.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36926","byteOffset":28314096,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_C42262EB","articyId":"72057697117166805","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"If it gets you outta here? Sure. If I remember correctly, Elias Malt was the lead on that accident. Yeah, definitely was, I remember watching him come through here all slick and shit.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If it gets you outta here? Sure. If I remember correctly, Elias Malt was the lead on that accident. Yeah, definitely was, I remember watching him come through here all slick and shit.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":8175.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37312","byteOffset":28455792,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_C299E63E","articyId":"72057697117166827","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Sage Hullen","text":"Don't mention it... Seriously, don't mention me to Elias, yeah? Don't need his slimy ass skulking around my hangouts.","speakerId":"Ntt_803F46BF","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Don't mention it... Seriously, don't mention me to Elias, yeah? Don't need his slimy ass skulking around my hangouts.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":8775.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38667","byteOffset":28962648,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_BC614CC0","articyId":"72057697117166564","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Nice to see you too.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nice to see you too.","TextSheVersion":"Nice to see you too.","TextTheyVersion":"Nice to see you too."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":700.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40334","byteOffset":29588912,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_D06A3970","articyId":"72057697117166571","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Have you heard of a CorpSec time travel initiative?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have you heard of a CorpSec time travel initiative?","TextSheVersion":"Have you heard of a CorpSec time travel initiative?","TextTheyVersion":"Have you heard of a CorpSec time travel initiative?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3675.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29214","byteOffset":18933096,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_6A2BB387","articyId":"72057697117166576","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know a John Doe?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronoun